        },
        "quote": "The Commission shall:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "89d9e35f-dcb3-5f59-ad2c-efea01335c4c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 281,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:1",
          "start": 22
        },
        "quote": "(a) Support and advise the City of Topeka in its efforts to eliminate prejudice on the basis of membership in a protected class described in TMC 9.20.020 , further goodwill among all people of the City and promote cooperation and conciliation within the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "fad5aec9-170a-59f5-8633-b0c440c96cee",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 820,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:2",
          "start": 282
        },
        "quote": "(b) Select one or more issues or topics of special focus to conduct research on, advocate on behalf of, and/or develop policy recommendations relating to, which shall be adopted on an annual basis by February 1st. The chosen issue or topic may be directly or indirectly related to the City of Topeka government and/or in the greater City of Topeka community. The Commission may produce progress reports, engage with staff, and/or engage with the Governing Body in this process. Results shall be reported in the Commission’s Annual Report.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "b1632cff-a41a-5ab2-ba36-3bc6ad1cb8f7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 941,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:3",
          "start": 821
        },
        "quote": "(c) Engage in one or more of the following activities relating to the Commission’s mission and/or chosen issue or topic:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b74ef197-79b3-5f32-a849-3fb4c5524801",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 988,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:4",
          "start": 942
        },
        "quote": "(1) Hold Town Hall meetings and public forums;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "71ba32d3-89df-514a-a2a5-1b8cf895ff41",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1109,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:5",
          "start": 989
        },
        "quote": "(2) Conduct inclusive outreach and education activities and develop resources relevant to human and civil rights issues;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "d33cdb3c-145b-54ce-9b12-72c1cc758b87",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1160,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:6",
          "start": 1110
        },
        "quote": "(3) Partner with related organizations and groups;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "dc0b8968-e3a7-5890-aa35-d03944cb8cb1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1329,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:7",
          "start": 1161
        },
        "quote": "(4) Develop and administer annual and/or periodic programs recognizing individuals and/or organizations who have advanced the mission of the Human Relations Commission;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "7851223d-300a-541b-a6ce-f70c1aa687a3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1559,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:8",
          "start": 1330
        },
        "quote": "(5) Refer public concerns related to civil and human rights to the appropriate agency and/or Governing Body for the sole purpose of providing assistance and support to the aggrieved party or parties as they pursue redress; and/or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "68a69876-0852-5e35-9396-d77a052e899e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1800,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:9",
          "start": 1560
        },
        "quote": "(6) Develop and recommend policy and/or administrative changes to the City Manager and Governing Body when the Commission finds a special need for such or deems necessary because of concerns received under subsection (c)(5) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "d0f1a20e-49fb-5156-945e-5787604cf04a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1882,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:10",
          "start": 1801
        },
        "quote": "(d) Review quarterly contracting reports and report concerns to the City Manager.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "f32ded6e-efbd-55b0-8537-c88cbfb52fbf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1992,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:11",
          "start": 1883
        },
        "quote": "(e) Review quarterly reports from the Independent Police Auditor and report any concerns to the City Manager.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.255.040 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "f97cc2e7-daf9-57a8-a8e9-32b4831a56cc",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2510,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:12",
          "start": 1993
        },
        "quote": "(f) By February 1st on an annual basis, the Commission shall prepare and submit an annual report to the Governing Body of the Commission’s activities, identifying issues and problem areas within the Topeka community and, after reviewing the performance of the Commission during the year, propose any modifications to this chapter and Chapters 2.105 , 2.250 , and 9.20 TMC that would improve the effectiveness of the Commission and better fulfill the antidiscrimination policies of the City. (Ord. 20568 § 5, 6-17-25.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.255.040:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
